<title>THAILAND: Thai Telephone Q3 net falls 36.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Thai Telephone Q3 net falls 36.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the period ending Septemer 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			     Third quarter</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     0.21     vs	     0.50</p>
<p>    Net			158.96     vs	   251.64</p>
<p>				Nine months</p>
<p>    Share (baht)	     0.81     vs	     1.41</p>
<p>    Net			507.80     vs	   706.25</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is Thai Telephone and Telecommunication Plc, a telecommunications firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
